'''Vaasan Palloseura''', commonly known as '''VPS''', is a Finnish professional [[association football|football]] club based in [[Vaasa]]. It currently plays in the first tier of Finnish football, [[Veikkausliiga]]. The club plays its home matches at [[Hietalahti Stadium]]. VPS played twice in the [[UEFA Cup]], in [[UEFA Cup 1998–99|1998–99]] and [[UEFA Cup 1999–00|1999–00]].

== Achievements ==
*'''[[Mestaruussarja]]/[[Veikkausliiga]]'''
**'''Winners''': [[1945 Mestaruussarja|1945]], [[1948 Mestaruussarja|1948]]
**Runners-up: (5) [[1932 Mestaruussarja – Finnish League Championship|1932]], [[1941 Mestaruussarja – Finnish League Championship|1940–41]], [[1949 Mestaruussarja|1949]], [[1997 Veikkausliiga|1997]], [[1998 Veikkausliiga|1998]]
**Third place: (3) [[1938 Mestaruussarja – Finnish League Championship|1938]], [[2013 Veikkausliiga|2013]], [[2023 Veikkausliiga|2023]]<ref>[https://www.hs.fi/urheilu/art-2000009908629.html Draamaa Vaasassa - VPS nousi voittoon ja pronssille lisäajalla, HJK:n mestaruusjuhlat siirtyivät], helsinginsanomat.fi, 8 October 2023</ref>
*'''[[Ykkönen]]'''
**'''Winners''': 2021
*'''[[Finnish Cup]]'''
**Runners-up: 1972
*'''[[Finnish League Cup]]'''
**'''Winners''': 1999, 2000
**Runners-up: 1997, 2014

